  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d196a0535c375e54bbd06bd3726e1d9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: UponEnter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequence:
  - name: 
    character: 25
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: 
    content:
    - Try to reach the end of the dungeon by going through floors! Find the staircase
      to go down to the next floor.
    - Use arrow keys to move around the dungeon. Do note that you can only move in
      8 directions.
    - As you traverse through the dungeon, enemies may attack you!
    - Press X to OPEN and CLOSE your menu. You can find some special moves there!
    - Don't let you or your party members' health reach 0, or it's game over.
    - The orange bar and purple bar under your health are your energy(EN) and mana(MN).
      You'll need those to use moves.
    - The tall yellow bar is your hunger. Eat something food to fill it up. Once
      it reaches 0, your health will drain over time.
    - Good luck!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
